// below is a thin wrapper that supplies the real auth/lock/thread.
//
// Why this exists: the previous tests for this route asserted on the TEXT of
// gate.js (`assert.match(block, /meshReadAuthed/)`). A deliberate re-break of
// the fix they were guarding passed all of them, because a regex over source
// cannot tell whether a gate still runs -- only that the word is still there.
//
// `loadThread` and `loadChain` are THUNKS, not values, on purpose: an
