// token overlap and return clusters at/over `threshold`. Greedy single-link: each
// card joins the first existing cluster it's similar ENOUGH to (>= simThreshold
// overlap with that cluster's seed), else it seeds a new one. Greedy is fine here
// -- we're flagging an obvious pile-up, not doing precise taxonomy. Returns
