// counted, return the EXISTING bucket key this title belongs to, or the title's
// own fresh signature if it matches none. This is the load-bearing agreement on
// what "the same task" is: the varied-title incident cards ("Write the
// drafted...", "Save the corrected...", "Pull the card body...") do NOT share an
// identical token SET, so exact-signature equality would give each its own
// counter and the runaway would never accumulate. Instead a re-worded proposal
// folds into the bucket of the FIRST signature it shares >=FLOOR significant
