// The legitimate need is tiny: a task fans out into a couple of genuine follow-on
// children ONCE. A signature reappearing a 3rd time is the runaway signature
// (the same work proposed over and over), not healthy fan-out -- so 2 proposals
// of one signature are allowed; the 3rd trips the breaker. Set well below the
// loop DETECTOR's threshold of 4 so the breaker STOPS the pile-up before the
// detector would even have 4 cards to alert on -- prevention, not just warning.
