// Given the running counter map (signature -> count) and a proposed handoff
// title, decide whether to SPAWN the card or PARK the originating task, and
// MUTATE the counter accordingly. Extracted as a pure function so the exact logic
// production runs is unit-tested directly (the incident replay drives THIS, not a
// re-implementation). Returns:
//   { action: "spawn", sig }             -> create the child; counter bumped
//   { action: "park",  sig, count }      -> at/over cap; do NOT create, park once
//   { action: "spawn", sig: "" }         -> unidentifiable title; never counted
