    // That flag is deliberate and stays: an agent that can edit its own
    // ~/.codex/config.toml must not be able to change how it is launched. The
    // cost is that the operator's `model = ...` in that file reaches CHAT runs
    // (which read user config) and never reaches AUTONOMOUS ones, so the two
    // paths can silently run different models on the same box.
