// sufficient explanation and I could not reproduce one. The recovery below is
// therefore written to survive ANY stuck cause rather than the one theorised:
// a stamped flag that expires, plus this function's own settle timer, plus a
// deferred call so a SYNCHRONOUS throw from askEngineReady becomes a rejection
// instead of escaping past .finally() with the flag still set.
