      // wrong for a STUCK one: on 2026-08-08 this condition held for 63 minutes
      // and the log said almost nothing, because a state that never changes never
      // re-announces. Same lesson as the gated-backlog reminder (#260) — say it
      // again while it is still true, on a long cadence with a hard floor, and go
      // quiet the moment it clears.
